&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
 &lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img alt="단계별로 향상되는 디테일3" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/11/17/80fed0e52acf4603-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
